    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is36">
        <head xml:id="gom-is36-Hd1e98">Caput 36</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is36-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is36-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is36-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is36-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is36_1@1-3">Et factum est.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is36-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is36-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is36-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Libri Regum et Paralipomenorum consentiunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Jerusalem obsedit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is36-Dd1e122">
          <head xml:id="gom-is36-Hd1e124">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is36-d1e126">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is36-Qd1e128" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is36_3@14-14">Sobna.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is36-Rd1e131"><name xml:id="gom-is36-Nd1e132" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is36-Qd1e135">Sobna scriba, alius, non superbus, qui, ut tradunt Haebraei, comminatione Rabsacis perterritus, inferiorem partem civitatis <pb ed="#P" n="1277D"/> tradidit, arce remanente et templo.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is36-Dd1e142">
          <head xml:id="gom-is36-Hd1e144">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is36-d1e146">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is36-Qd1e148" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is36_4@8-9">Haec dicit.</quote>
            Sicut forsan a patre audierat, haec dicit Dominus: et ut verba ejus habeant majus pondus, notat arrogantiam: Haec dicit rex magnus, quasi contraria fortitudo.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is36-Dd1e153">
          <head xml:id="gom-is36-Hd1e155">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is36-d1e157">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is36-Qd1e159" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is36_6@1-2">Ecce confidis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is36-Rd1e162"><name xml:id="gom-is36-Nd1e163" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is36-Qd1e166">Mentitur plane. Nusquam enim legitur Ezechiam in Aegypto spem posuisse.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is36-Dd1e171">
          <head xml:id="gom-is36-Hd1e173">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is36-d1e175">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is36-Qd1e177" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is36_8@15-16">Nec poteris.</quote>
            Non ex imbecillitate, sed praeceptorum Domini observatione, qui per Moysen de rege Israel praecepit, dicens: <quote xml:id="gom-is36-Qd1e180">Non multiplicabis tibi equos, et currus, nec uxores plurimas.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is36-Dd1e184">
          <head xml:id="gom-is36-Hd1e186">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is36-d1e188">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is36-Qd1e190" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is36_16@9-11">Facite mecum benedictionem,</quote>
            etc. Laudate me, benedicite me. Vel sicut habet alia <pb ed="#P" n="1278A"/> editio: Facite quod vobis utile est, ut me recipiatis et pax maneat vobiscum.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
